{"en": "52560162", "title": "OpenELIS Global", "adf": {"type": "doc", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "attrs": {"localId": "893d0d88b232"}, "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Bienvenue dans l'espace de documentation d'OpenELIS Global. OpenELIS Global est un système d'information de laboratoire (SIL) open source utilisé dans des laboratoires cliniques du monde entier. Cet espace est maintenu par la communauté OpenELIS Global comme source de référence vivante pour la documentation produit, la documentation de mise en œuvre et la documentation pour les développeurs."}]}, {"type": "paragraph", "attrs": {"localId": "c52531a5bf5e"}, "content": [{"type": "emoji", "attrs": {"id": "1f500", "text": "🔀", "shortName": ":twisted_rightwards_arrows:", "localId": "a97540f68e8c"}}, {"type": "text", "text": " "}, {"type": "text", "text": "Navigation : choisissez votre parcours", "marks": [{"type": "link", "attrs": {"href": "https://uwdigi.atlassian.net/wiki/spaces/OG/pages/52560162/OpenELIS+Global#Start-here-%E2%80%94-pick-your-path"}}, {"type": "strong"}]}]}, {"type": "paragraph", "attrs": {"localId": "e971d327aa0b"}, "content": [{"type": "emoji", "attrs": {"id": "atlassian-logo_jira_product_discovery", "text": ":logo_jira_product_discovery:", "shortName": ":logo_jira_product_discovery:", "localId": "c0a773038468"}}, {"type": "text", "text": " "}, {"type": "text", "text": "Navigation dans le produit OpenELIS", "marks": [{"type": "link", "attrs": {"href": "https://uwdigi.atlassian.net/wiki/spaces/OG/pages/52560162/OpenELIS+Global#OpenELIS-Product-Navigation"}}, {"type": "strong"}]}]}, {"type": "paragraph", "attrs": {"localId": "41be6b1a5954"}, "content": [{"type": "emoji", "attrs": {"id": "atlassian-question_mark", "text": ":question_mark:", "shortName": ":question_mark:", "localId": "23d455eeb8fa"}}, {"type": "text", "text": " "}, {"type": "text", "text": "Obtenir de l'aide et rester informé", "marks": [{"type": "link", "attrs": {"href": "https://uwdigi.atlassian.net/wiki/spaces/OG/pages/52560162/OpenELIS+Global#%3Aquestion_mark%3A-Get-help-%26-stay-current"}}, {"type": "strong"}]}]}, {"type": "rule", "attrs": {"localId": "7b6e56c45ef7"}}, {"type": "heading", "attrs": {"level": 2, "localId": "d25bd101b656"}, "content": [{"type": "emoji", "attrs": {"id": "1f500", "text": "🔀", "shortName": ":twisted_rightwards_arrows:", "localId": "7ec155e3757b"}}, {"type": "text", "text": " Commencez ici : choisissez votre parcours"}]}, {"type": "layoutSection", "attrs": {"localId": "20e13f57a369"}, "marks": [{"type": "breakout", "attrs": {"mode": "wide", "width": 760}}], "content": [{"type": "layoutColumn", "attrs": {"width": 50.0, "localId": "18c6b2892af0"}, "content": [{"type": "heading", "attrs": {"level": 3, "localId": "0426aab89e40"}, "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "👩‍🔬 Pour le personnel de laboratoire", "marks": [{"type": "link", "attrs": {"href": "https://uwdigi.atlassian.net/wiki/spaces/oeg/pages/1326972929"}}]}]}, {"type": "paragraph", "attrs": {"localId": "02c4ad7bc996"}, "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Utilisateurs finaux (techniciens de laboratoire, biologistes, pathologistes) et administrateurs de laboratoire. Manuel de l'utilisateur et aide-mémoire, manuel de l'administrateur et aide-mémoire, cahiers de laboratoire, French / Fonctionnalités d'OpenELIS."}]}]}, {"type": "layoutColumn", "attrs": {"width": 50.0, "localId": "7dd663583be5"}, "content": [{"type": "heading", "attrs": {"level": 3, "localId": "bb12d97d07b3"}, "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "🚀 Pour les équipes de mise en œuvre", "marks": [{"type": "link", "attrs": {"href": "https://uwdigi.atlassian.net/wiki/spaces/oeg/pages/1326252042"}}]}]}, {"type": "paragraph", "attrs": {"localId": "f895aed2d420"}, "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Déployer OpenELIS Global sur un nouveau site ou dans un nouveau pays. Installation et mise à niveau, déploiement, intégrations OpenMRS et Odoo, Configuration Initializer, authentification unique (Single Sign On), traduction, mises en œuvre par pays."}]}]}]}, {"type": "layoutSection", "attrs": {"localId": "45d2cb375c3c"}, "marks": [{"type": "breakout", "attrs": {"mode": "wide", "width": 760}}], "content": [{"type": "layoutColumn", "attrs": {"width": 50.0, "localId": "c279766e51f1"}, "content": [{"type": "heading", "attrs": {"level": 3, "localId": "52012d2e80ff"}, "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "👩‍💻 Pour les développeurs", "marks": [{"type": "link", "attrs": {"href": "https://uwdigi.atlassian.net/wiki/spaces/oeg/pages/1326481413"}}]}]}, {"type": "paragraph", "attrs": {"localId": "86ea51022382"}, "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Ingénieurs qui contribuent au code, créent des intégrations ou étendent OpenELIS Global. Environnement de développement, guide d'implémentation FHIR, cadre d'assurance qualité, aspects techniques du RBAC, notions de base du domaine du laboratoire pour les nouveaux contributeurs."}]}]}, {"type": "layoutColumn", "attrs": {"width": 50.0, "localId": "02f95323e7b4"}, "content": [{"type": "heading", "attrs": {"level": 3, "localId": "9fac9e525df4"}, "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "⚙️ Pour les administrateurs système et opérateurs", "marks": [{"type": "link", "attrs": {"href": "https://uwdigi.atlassian.net/wiki/spaces/oeg/pages/1325793288"}}]}]}, {"type": "paragraph", "attrs": {"localId": "c328d780f22e"}, "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Exploiter OpenELIS Global en production. Sauvegardes, basculement haute disponibilité, migration des mots de passe, mises à niveau, dépannage, exploitation du serveur consolidé."}]}]}]}, {"type": "layoutSection", "attrs": {"localId": "eb66743663d5"}, "marks": [{"type": "breakout", "attrs": {"mode": "wide", "width": 760}}], "content": [{"type": "layoutColumn", "attrs": {"width": 50.0, "localId": "da8b908a1f73"}, "content": [{"type": "heading", "attrs": {"level": 3, "localId": "704c4e78a8d4"}, "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "🤝 Communauté", "marks": [{"type": "link", "attrs": {"href": "https://uwdigi.atlassian.net/wiki/spaces/oeg/pages/1326055432"}}]}]}, {"type": "paragraph", "attrs": {"localId": "a5cc25530585"}, "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Où vit la communauté OpenELIS Global, comment contribuer, GSoC, Volunteer of the Month, comptes rendus de réunion, guide de style. Liens vers le forum Talk et GitHub à l'intérieur."}]}]}, {"type": "layoutColumn", "attrs": {"width": 50.0, "localId": "c9cd7f5474b9"}, "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "attrs": {"localId": "1cdc5f2412c9"}}]}]}, {"type": "rule", "attrs": {"localId": "294220334ed9"}}, {"type": "heading", "attrs": {"level": 2, "localId": "bd9c8b0e96a0"}, "content": [{"type": "emoji", "attrs": {"id": "atlassian-logo_jira_product_discovery", "text": ":logo_jira_product_discovery:", "shortName": ":logo_jira_product_discovery:", "localId": "ebf2ab88-9ddd-4bb3-a82e-390e74e7ccb3"}}, {"type": "text", "text": " Navigation dans le produit OpenELIS"}]}, {"type": "layoutSection", "attrs": {"localId": "cd3f5436-5dcb-46b3-905e-a751edbf9315"}, "marks": [{"type": "breakout", "attrs": {"mode": "wide", "width": 760}}], "content": [{"type": "layoutColumn", "attrs": {"width": 50.0, "localId": "8732d2b2-1bbe-4e4d-a21e-022ba916f3e4"}, "content": [{"type": "heading", "attrs": {"level": 3, "localId": "e225072ceeaf"}, "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "ℹ️ À propos d'OpenELIS Global", "marks": [{"type": "link", "attrs": {"href": "https://uwdigi.atlassian.net/wiki/spaces/oeg/pages/239337475"}}]}]}, {"type": "paragraph", "attrs": {"localId": "304a4b1d9ca2"}, "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Présentation du projet, mission, historique, principaux partenaires.  Commencez ici si vous souhaitez comprendre ce qu'offre OpenELIS Global dans son ensemble.  Vous pouvez aussi consulter notre site web principal : "}, {"type": "inlineCard", "attrs": {"localId": "2bf63720bf3a", "url": "https://openelis-global.org/"}}, {"type": "text", "text": " "}]}]}, {"type": "layoutColumn", "attrs": {"width": 50.0, "localId": "98e0158f-2e57-45f0-a539-de201731b0c6"}, "content": [{"type": "heading", "attrs": {"level": 3, "localId": "f8566c785c62"}, "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "🧩 Modules et fonctionnalités", "marks": [{"type": "link", "attrs": {"href": "https://uwdigi.atlassian.net/wiki/spaces/oeg/pages/1325727762"}}]}]}, {"type": "paragraph", "attrs": {"localId": "4b896727facd"}, "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Une page par module. RBAC, signatures électroniques, catalogue de tests, stockage des échantillons, EEQ, Westgard, expédition des échantillons, gestion des patients, rapports, et plus de 20 autres."}]}]}]}, {"type": "layoutSection", "attrs": {"localId": "b6faaf81a359"}, "marks": [{"type": "breakout", "attrs": {"mode": "wide", "width": 760}}], "content": [{"type": "layoutColumn", "attrs": {"width": 50.0, "localId": "5e4f0ca12daf"}, "content": [{"type": "heading", "attrs": {"level": 3, "localId": "f9454fde4408"}, "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "📦 Versions", "marks": [{"type": "link", "attrs": {"href": "https://uwdigi.atlassian.net/wiki/spaces/oeg/pages/1326219273"}}]}]}, {"type": "paragraph", "attrs": {"localId": "8b456b52800f"}, "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Version de production actuelle, cible de développement v3.2, feuille de route de l'interopérabilité, versions précédentes. "}, {"type": "text", "text": "Suivez cette page", "marks": [{"type": "strong"}]}, {"type": "text", "text": " pour être averti de la sortie d'une nouvelle version."}]}]}, {"type": "layoutColumn", "attrs": {"width": 50.0, "localId": "62cd9c8ebfe1"}, "content": [{"type": "heading", "attrs": {"level": 3, "localId": "88f59360256f"}, "content": [{"type": "emoji", "attrs": {"id": "atlassian-direct_hit", "text": ":direct_hit:", "shortName": ":direct_hit:", "localId": "804603205d8b"}}, {"type": "text", "text": " "}, {"type": "text", "text": "Feuille de route du produit", "marks": [{"type": "link", "attrs": {"href": "https://uwdigi.atlassian.net/wiki/spaces/oeg/pages/640319495"}}]}]}, {"type": "paragraph", "attrs": {"localId": "1bd3c65a22cf"}, "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Fonctionnalités futures prévues pour le développement et la publication."}]}]}]}, {"type": "rule", "attrs": {"localId": "a00333be4df8"}}, {"type": "heading", "attrs": {"level": 2, "localId": "fbdf3ab84c04"}, "content": [{"type": "emoji", "attrs": {"id": "atlassian-question_mark", "text": ":question_mark:", "shortName": ":question_mark:", "localId": "061910d17100"}}, {"type": "text", "text": " Obtenir de l'aide et rester informé"}]}, {"type": "layoutSection", "attrs": {"localId": "5893a8e45898"}, "marks": [{"type": "breakout", "attrs": {"mode": "wide", "width": 760}}], "content": [{"type": "layoutColumn", "attrs": {"width": 50.0, "localId": "041cedb3b962"}, "content": [{"type": "panel", "attrs": {"panelType": "success", "localId": "ea0d0ff3e469"}, "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "attrs": {"localId": "22700fe96cf8"}, "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "🆘 ", "marks": [{"type": "strong"}]}, {"type": "text", "text": "Obtenir de l'aide", "marks": [{"type": "link", "attrs": {"href": "https://uwdigi.atlassian.net/wiki/spaces/oeg/pages/1328185376"}}, {"type": "strong"}]}]}, {"type": "paragraph", "attrs": {"localId": "c7982ff2b096"}, "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Questions d'utilisation, signalements de bogues, demandes de fonctionnalités, corrections de documentation, aide à la mise en œuvre : quel canal utiliser dans chaque cas. Guide des bonnes pratiques inclus."}]}]}]}, {"type": "layoutColumn", "attrs": {"width": 50.0, "localId": "423fa372c663"}, "content": [{"type": "panel", "attrs": {"panelType": "info", "localId": "aad39fc5f728"}, "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "attrs": {"localId": "aafd845f8d37"}, "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "🔔 ", "marks": [{"type": "strong"}]}, {"type": "text", "text": "Suivre et rester informé", "marks": [{"type": "link", "attrs": {"href": "https://uwdigi.atlassian.net/wiki/spaces/oeg/pages/1328316419"}}, {"type": "strong"}]}]}, {"type": "paragraph", "attrs": {"localId": "03aab48037f4"}, "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Comment s'abonner à Confluence, GitHub et Talk pour que les mises à jour de la documentation viennent à vous au lieu d'avoir à les chercher. Abonnements recommandés selon le rôle."}]}]}]}]}, {"type": "heading", "attrs": {"level": 2, "localId": "b2b68b4ed846"}, "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Où vit la communauté"}]}, {"type": "bulletList", "attrs": {"localId": "12a2126fc4ca"}, "content": [{"type": "listItem", "attrs": {"localId": "fd6477897a5f"}, "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "attrs": {"localId": "73b03eae65dd"}, "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "talk.openelis-global.org", "marks": [{"type": "link", "attrs": {"href": "https://talk.openelis-global.org"}}, {"type": "strong"}]}, {"type": "text", "text": " : forum de discussion principal"}]}]}, {"type": "listItem", "attrs": {"localId": "81d76d6cce7b"}, "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "attrs": {"localId": "f6b9036237da"}, "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "DIGI-UW/OpenELIS-Global-2", "marks": [{"type": "link", "attrs": {"href": "https://github.com/DIGI-UW/OpenELIS-Global-2"}}, {"type": "strong"}]}, {"type": "text", "text": " : code source, tickets, pull requests"}]}]}, {"type": "listItem", "attrs": {"localId": "3e899f68c4b7"}, "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "attrs": {"localId": "edda3a3b6d28"}, "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "docs.openelis-global.org", "marks": [{"type": "link", "attrs": {"href": "https://docs.openelis-global.org/"}}, {"type": "strong"}]}, {"type": "text", "text": " : documentation publiée pour les développeurs"}]}]}]}, {"type": "rule", "attrs": {"localId": "13dac43589f5"}}, {"type": "paragraph", "attrs": {"localId": "0097ec86ed88"}, "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "📋 "}, {"type": "text", "text": "Plan de travail de la refonte Confluence", "marks": [{"type": "link", "attrs": {"href": "https://uwdigi.atlassian.net/wiki/spaces/oeg/pages/1326120978"}}]}, {"type": "text", "text": "  ·  Dernière mise à jour le 2026-05-21 par l'équipe de documentation OEG"}]}], "version": 1}}